                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "2 Minute Video Review → https://youtu.be/h11N1p07sho\n\nDream UniVRse is a series of random mini games. Similar to the classic Warioware games. There's a story mode and arcade mode. I found story mode to have way too much explaining and reading for this style of game. So I stuck with arcade mode which lets you play right away. \n\nThe mini game challenges are very random and diverse which is just what I wanted. And the preparation area does a great job of showing you how far you might need to walk or move for the mini game. That way you can rearrange your cord and spin around before it begins. \n\nOne thing I think the game really needs is frantic music, both in the preparation area and during the mini games. Having that will add a much greater sense of urgency and excitement to all the mini games. Right now without music it lacks the chaos and energy that I wanted. For a good example of that you can play Egg Time, which is free. \n\nRight now this is a good set of mini games. But hopefully they'll add music which would transform this to a great set of mini games.",
